---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="Hekara — Run your home health agency on software you own"
  description="Hekara is open-source home health agency software. Schedule visits, coordinate caregivers, track credentials and billing, and self-host your data."
>
  <main>
    <section class="hero" id="platform">
      <div class="hero-photo" role="img" aria-label="Abstract green Hekara product backdrop"></div>
      <div class="hero-shade"></div>
      <div class="hero-inner">
        <div class="hero-copy">
          <div class="eyebrow eyebrow-light"><span class="eyebrow-line"></span> OPEN-SOURCE HOME HEALTH OPERATIONS</div>
          <h1>Care moves fast.<br /><em>Your software should, too.</em></h1>
          <p>Hekara brings schedules, staffing, compliance and billing into one calm operating system—on infrastructure you control.</p>
          <div class="hero-buttons">
            <a class="button button-dark" href="https://github.com/Srinivas26k/Hekara#quick-start" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Explore the project <span>↗</span></a>
            <a class="button button-glass" href="#workflow"><span class="play-icon">↓</span> See the workflow</a>
          </div>
          <a class="ph-featured" href="https://www.producthunt.com/products/hekara?embed=true&amp;utm_source=badge-featured&amp;utm_medium=badge&amp;utm_campaign=badge-hekara" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><img alt="Hekara - Home health agency operations you can self-host | Product Hunt" width="250" height="54" src="https://api.producthunt.com/widgets/embed-image/v1/featured.svg?post_id=1328941&amp;theme=light&amp;t=1795690059248" /></a>
          <div class="hero-proof">
            <span class="proof-icon">⌘</span>
            <span>Self-hosted · AGPL-3.0 · Alpha</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-note">
          <span class="note-spark">✳</span>
          <span>Made for teams<br /><strong>who show up.</strong></span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="dashboard-wrap">
        <div class="dashboard-window">
          <div class="window-topbar">
            <div class="window-brand"><span class="mini-mark">h</span> Hekara <span class="window-divider">/</span> Schedule</div>
            <div class="window-controls"><span class="window-live"><i></i> Live view</span><span>•••</span></div>
          </div>
          <img class="dashboard-image" src="/Hekara/images/schedule.png" alt="Hekara caregiver schedule dashboard showing visits, open shifts and staffing timeline" />
          <div class="window-caption"><span class="caption-check">✓</span> A shared view of the day, for the whole team.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="floating-card floating-card-left">
          <span class="float-icon float-green">↗</span><span><small>Open shifts</small><strong>Find the right cover</strong></span>
        </div>
        <div class="floating-card floating-card-right">
          <span class="float-icon float-blue">⌁</span><span><small>Team overview</small><strong>Always in sync</strong></span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="trust-strip">
      <span>MADE FOR THE PEOPLE BEHIND EVERY VISIT</span>
      <div class="trust-items"><span>Agency owners</span><b>·</b><span>Schedulers</span><b>·</b><span>Caregivers</span><b>·</b><span>Billing teams</span></div>
    </section>

    <section class="intro section-pad" id="workflow">
      <div class="section-kicker"><span class="kicker-square">✳</span> A CALMER WAY TO COORDINATE</div>
      <div class="intro-grid">
        <h2>Every moving part<br /><em>in one place.</em></h2>
        <div class="intro-text">
          <p>Home health work moves across people, schedules and paperwork. Hekara brings the daily operation together, so your team can spend less time tracking things down and more time focused on care.</p>
          <a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/Srinivas26k/Hekara" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Take a closer look <span>↗</span></a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-grid">
        <article class="feature-card feature-card-large">
          <div class="feature-image-wrap">
            <img src="/Hekara/images/overview.png" alt="Hekara overview dashboard" loading="lazy" />
            <span class="image-chip"><span class="chip-dot"></span> Your agency at a glance</span>
          </div>
          <div class="feature-card-bottom">
            <div>
              <span class="feature-number">01</span>
              <h3>Dashboard</h3>
              <p>Agency owners see their whole operation at once—visits, schedules, staffing, and compliance.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-image-wrap">
            <img src="/Hekara/images/caregivers.png" alt="Hekara caregiver management" loading="lazy" />
            <span class="image-chip"><span class="chip-dot"></span> Who's available</span>
          </div>
          <div class="feature-card-bottom">
            <div>
              <span class="feature-number">02</span>
              <h3>Caregivers</h3>
              <p>Assign staff, track skills and certifications, and manage availability in real time.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-image-wrap">
            <img src="/Hekara/images/reports.png" alt="Hekara analytics and reporting" loading="lazy" />
            <span class="image-chip"><span class="chip-dot"></span> Measure and improve</span>
          </div>
          <div class="feature-card-bottom">
            <div>
              <span class="feature-number">03</span>
              <h3>Reports</h3>
              <p>Get insights on staffing, revenue, compliance and care quality from your data.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="workflow-section" id="features">
      <div class="section-pad">
        <div class="workflow-heading">
          <div>
            <div class="section-kicker"><span class="kicker-square">✳</span> WHAT WORKS</div>
            <h2>See a workflow<br />that makes<br /><em>sense</em></h2>
          </div>
          <p>Hekara handles the day-to-day that takes the most time and brain power. It scales as your agency grows.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="workflow-panel">
          <div class="workflow-steps">
            <button class="workflow-step active" data-step="0">
              <span class="step-index">01</span>
              <div>
                <strong>Schedule the visits</strong>
                <small>Assign caregivers to patient visits</small>
              </div>
            </button>
            <button class="workflow-step" data-step="1">
              <span class="step-index">02</span>
              <div>
                <strong>Fill open shifts</strong>
                <small>Get coverage for last-minute changes</small>
              </div>
            </button>
            <button class="workflow-step" data-step="2">
              <span class="step-index">03</span>
              <div>
                <strong>Track compliance</strong>
                <small>Keep certifications and training current</small>
              </div>
            </button>
            <button class="workflow-step" data-step="3">
              <span class="step-index">04</span>
              <div>
                <strong>Generate billing</strong>
                <small>Automate invoices and revenue reports</small>
              </div>
            </button>
          </div>
          <div class="workflow-visual">
            <img src="/Hekara/images/schedule.png" alt="Schedule visits in Hekara" class="workflow-image active" data-step="0" />
            <img src="/Hekara/images/caregivers.png" alt="Fill open shifts in Hekara" class="workflow-image" data-step="1" loading="lazy" />
            <img src="/Hekara/images/compliance.png" alt="Track compliance in Hekara" class="workflow-image" data-step="2" loading="lazy" />
            <img src="/Hekara/images/billing.png" alt="Generate billing in Hekara" class="workflow-image" data-step="3" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="department-section section-pad">
      <div class="department-head">
        <div>
          <div class="section-kicker"><span class="kicker-square">✳</span> BUILT FOR TEAMS</div>
          <h2>Every team member<br />gets a view built for<br /><em>their workflow.</em></h2>
        </div>
        <p>Hekara adapts to how your agency actually works. Each role sees the information that matters most.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="departments-grid">
        <article class="department-card">
          <div class="dept-icon">👩‍💼</div>
          <h3>Agency owners</h3>
          <p>Monitor staffing, compliance and revenue across your whole operation. Spot trends and make data-driven decisions.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="department-card">
          <div class="dept-icon">📋</div>
          <h3>Schedulers</h3>
          <p>Assign visits, manage caregiver availability, and quickly fill open shifts without the chaos of email chains.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="department-card">
          <div class="dept-icon">🏥</div>
          <h3>Caregivers</h3>
          <p>See your schedule, patient details, and get updates in real time. Mobile-friendly, designed for the field.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="department-card">
          <div class="dept-icon">💰</div>
          <h3>Billing teams</h3>
          <p>Generate accurate invoices, track claims and revenue. Compliance-ready reports with encrypted patient data.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="services-section section-pad" id="services">
      <div class="services-heading">
        <div>
          <div class="section-kicker"><span class="kicker-square">✳</span> FROM OPEN SOURCE TO YOUR OPERATION</div>
          <h2>Need Hekara to fit<br /><em>your agency?</em></h2>
        </div>
        <p>Work directly with the maintainer on a practical deployment, integrations, security-focused architecture, or a tailored workflow.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="services-grid">
        <article class="service-card"><span class="service-number">01</span><h3>Implementation</h3><p>Plan a self-hosted rollout, configure the foundation, and give your team a clear path to launch.</p></article>
        <article class="service-card"><span class="service-number">02</span><h3>Custom workflows</h3><p>Adapt Hekara to the scheduling, billing, reporting, and operating realities of your agency.</p></article>
        <article class="service-card"><span class="service-number">03</span><h3>Security &amp; compliance support</h3><p>Get help mapping technical safeguards, documenting controls, and preparing a more defensible deployment.</p></article>
      </div>
      <div class="services-cta"><div><strong>Have a project in mind?</strong><span>Start with a short, no-pressure conversation.</span></div><a class="button button-dark" href="/Hekara/contact">Talk about your project <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div>
    </section>

    <section class="security-section section-pad" id="security">
      <div class="security-layout">
        <div class="security-copy">
          <div class="section-kicker"><span class="kicker-square">✳</span> BUILT WITH TRUST</div>
          <h2>Your data stays<br /><em>your data.</em></h2>
          <p>Open source. No vendor lock-in. Encrypted at the application layer. Deploy anywhere.</p>
          <ul class="security-list">
            <li><strong>Application-layer encryption.</strong> Protected health information is encrypted before storage.</li>
            <li><strong>Self-hosted.</strong> Run on your servers. No SaaS dependency. Full control and portability.</li>
            <li><strong>Open source.</strong> Audit the code. AGPL-3.0 licensed. No black boxes.</li>
            <li><strong>Standards-based.</strong> PostgreSQL, WebCrypto, Web-standard APIs. Easy to integrate.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="security-visual">
          <div class="security-card">
            <span class="security-icon">🔐</span>
            <strong>Encrypted</strong>
            <small>Security-focused technical safeguards</small>
          </div>
          <div class="security-card">
            <span class="security-icon">🛡</span>
            <strong>Portable</strong>
            <small>Deploy on your infrastructure</small>
          </div>
          <div class="security-card">
            <span class="security-icon">📖</span>
            <strong>Open</strong>
            <small>100% source code transparency</small>
          </div>
          <div class="security-card">
            <span class="security-icon">⚡</span>
            <strong>Lightweight</strong>
            <small>Designed for lightweight self-hosting</small>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="open-source-section section-pad" id="open-source">
      <div class="open-source-layout">
        <div class="open-source-left">
          <div class="section-kicker"><span class="kicker-square">✳</span> THE CODE IS YOURS</div>
          <h2>Built in the open.<br /><em>For you.</em></h2>
          <p>No proprietary licensing. No surprise costs. No black boxes. Full AGPL-3.0 source code on GitHub. You own it, modify it, and deploy it anywhere.</p>
          <a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/Srinivas26k/Hekara" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">See the code on GitHub <span>↗</span></a>
        </div>
        <div class="open-source-right">
          <div class="code-block">
            <div class="code-header">$ quick start</div>
            <div class="code-content">
              <code>git clone https://github.com/Srinivas26k/Hekara.git<br/>
cd Hekara &amp;&amp; cp .env.example .env<br/>
pnpm install &amp;&amp; pnpm keygen<br/>
docker compose up -d db<br/>
pnpm db:migrate &amp;&amp; pnpm db:seed<br/>
pnpm build &amp;&amp; pnpm start<br/>
<span class="code-ready">✓ http://localhost:3000</span></code>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="faq-section section-pad">
      <div class="faq-heading">
        <h2>Got questions?<br /><em>We have answers.</em></h2>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-grid">
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary><strong>How much does Hekara cost?</strong></summary>
          <p>Hekara is free and open source. No licensing fees. You pay only for your hosting infrastructure (cloud or on-premise). One server can handle hundreds of users.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary><strong>Can I self-host?</strong></summary>
          <p>Yes. Deploy on your own servers, AWS, Azure, Cloudflare, or anywhere you like. The code is yours. Full portability with no vendor lock-in.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary><strong>Is Hekara HIPAA compliant?</strong></summary>
          <p>Software alone cannot be HIPAA compliant. Hekara provides technical safeguards such as application-layer encryption, audit logging, and access controls; your organization remains responsible for its complete compliance program.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary><strong>What about data portability?</strong></summary>
          <p>All data uses standard SQL schemas. Export to any format. Migrate to another system anytime. No proprietary data formats that lock you in.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary><strong>What support is available?</strong></summary>
          <p>Community support on GitHub. Documentation, quick-start guide, and architecture docs included. For enterprise support, sponsorship and custom development are available.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary><strong>Can I modify the code?</strong></summary>
          <p>Yes. AGPL-3.0 license means you can modify, distribute, and run modified versions. Contributing back to the project is encouraged.</p>
        </details>
      </div>
    </section>
    <script type="application/ld+json" is:inline set:html={JSON.stringify({
      "@context": "https://schema.org",
      "@type": "FAQPage",
      mainEntity: [
        { "@type": "Question", name: "How much does Hekara cost?", acceptedAnswer: { "@type": "Answer", text: "Hekara is free and open source. You pay only for your hosting infrastructure." } },
        { "@type": "Question", name: "Can I self-host Hekara?", acceptedAnswer: { "@type": "Answer", text: "Yes. Hekara is designed to be deployed on infrastructure you control." } },
        { "@type": "Question", name: "Is Hekara HIPAA compliant?", acceptedAnswer: { "@type": "Answer", text: "Software alone cannot be HIPAA compliant. Hekara provides technical safeguards, while each organization is responsible for its complete compliance program." } }
      ]
    })} />

    <section class="final-cta" id="cta">
      <div class="section-pad cta-inner">
        <h2>Run your agency<br />on software you<br /><em>own.</em></h2>
        <p>Hekara is open, secure, and yours.</p>
        <div class="cta-buttons">
          <a class="button button-dark" href="https://github.com/Srinivas26k/Hekara#quick-start" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Get started on GitHub <span>↗</span></a>
          <a class="button button-light" href="#top">Back to top</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>

